@host = https://localhost:7216

### 1. Login Manager → attendu 200 + token
# @name loginManager
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "karim@teamdesk.local", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### 2. Login User → attendu 200 + token
# @name loginUser
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "sara@teamdesk.local", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### 3. Mauvais mot de passe → attendu 401
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "sara@teamdesk.local", "password": "faux" }

### 4. Liste sans token → attendu 401
GET {{host}}/api/requests

### 5. Liste avec token User → attendu 200
GET {{host}}/api/requests?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.token}}

### 6. Détail d'une demande → attendu 200
GET {{host}}/api/requests/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.token}}

### 7. User crée une demande → attendu 201
POST {{host}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Nouvel écran", "description": "Mon écran ne s'allume plus", "categoryId": 1, "priority": "High" }

### 8. User essaie d'assigner → attendu 403
PUT {{host}}/api/requests/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assignedToId": 2 }

### 9. Manager assigne la demande 1 à Sara (Id 2) → attendu 204
PUT {{host}}/api/requests/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assignedToId": 2 }

### 10. Sara (assignée) change le statut → attendu 204
PATCH {{host}}/api/requests/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "InProgress" }

### 11. Commentaire → attendu 201
POST {{host}}/api/requests/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Je m'en occupe." }

### 12. Commentaire sur une demande inexistante → attendu 404
POST {{host}}/api/requests/999/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Test" }

### 13. Dashboard en User → attendu 403
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.token}}

### 14. Dashboard en Manager → attendu 200
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.$.token}}